{"id":"946d1639a1c3cf2a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-meetclosurelaws.md","title":"Conjunction closure laws","display":"thm-meetclosurelaws — Conjunction closure laws","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-meetclosurelaws","aliases":["27-thm-meetclosurelaws"],"display":"thm-meetclosurelaws — Conjunction closure laws","depends_on":["[[27-df-meetclosure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-meetclosurelaws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-meetclosurelaws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-meetclosurelaws — Conjunction closure laws"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\land(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(B))\\land\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A))=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\land(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(B))\\land\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A))=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Lemma 6.1，印刷页 278，PDF 第 302 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对定义推导：单点交给扩张性，子族包含给单调性，非空子族的非空交可展平成原集合一个非空子族的交给幂等性。空集情形也是空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-meetclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-meetclosure]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\land(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(B))\\land\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A))=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(A)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1078,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-460","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-meetclosurelaws|thm-meetclosurelaws — Conjunction closure laws]]"},{"id":"1bbf751ce7a46128","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ed790009f55244ee","5d10aed668d85817"]}